        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9035/38, 1-1/2 Inch Helsinki Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Helsinki Cabinet Knob is easy to install and comes with all the necessary hardware. It is great not only for modern kitchens, but also to revamp your furniture. Builder's hardware often has no life, so add contemporary style to your cabinets, vanities, and light-weight furniture doors and drawers with the Omnia 9035/38 1-1/2 Inch Helsinki Cabinet Door Knob. If you are remodeling your kitchen, chances are you'll need cabinet pulls, don't worry, we've got you covered with an entire <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\">Omnia Ultima Collection</a> of modern cabinet hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-helsinki-cabinet-knob-omnia-9035-25\"><b>1 Inch Diameter Helsinki Cabinet Knob</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-diameter-helsinki-cabinet-knob-omnia-9035-32\"><b>1-1/4 Inch Diameter Helsinki Cabinet Knob</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9035 Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
